{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["schemaVersion","markerPath","targetKind","targetName"],"description":"The closed PREIMAGE of a compilation unit identity, published here with its domain, codec and selector precisely so that unitId is not an opaque digest: any consumer can rebuild these four fields from the unit row that carries them and recompute the identity. A delimiter-joined label was the earlier draft and is WITHDRAWN - it was injective only by excluding # from markerPath, and a # in a repository directory is admissible under the canonical repository-path contract, so that recipe narrowed admitted paths to make a delimiter work. H over this projection needs no such restriction and is fixed width for every admitted path and name length.","properties":{"schemaVersion":{"const":1},"markerPath":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":4096,"pattern":"^(?!/)(?!.*(^|/)\\.\\.?(/|$))[^\\u0000\\\\]+(?![\\s\\S])"},"targetKind":{"type":"string","enum":["lib","bin","test","bench","example","build-script"]},"targetName":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":256,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+(?![\\s\\S])"}}}
